    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5961" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφινέμομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwell round,</i> c.
			acc. loci, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὑάμπολιν ἀμφενέμοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.521
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὄλυμπον ἀ.,</span> of gods,
				<i><span class="en">
				18.186
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰθάκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.132
				</span></i>
			; of constellations, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δὔ Ἰχθύες ἀμφινέμονται Ἵππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					282
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				127
			</span></i>, al.: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ ὄλβος ἀ.</span>
			<i>encompasses</i> thee, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i>.</div>
